      "Id": "dd86829fd0eb5409c4e4052a8e9438d1",
      "Text": "WHAT IT DOES: takes one clash test from the document, lists its results and writes each as a BCF topic (with camera, component GUIDs and a snapshot) into the .bcfzip. TO CHANGE: the test number (0 is the first) and the file path.",
